    "text": "VMAX Special Set Eevee Heroes, released on 28 May 2021 with the Eevee Heroes expansion: eight Eevee Heroes packs and a VMAX promo card pack holding one of four card sets, Flareon VMAX, Vaporeon VMAX, Jolteon VMAX or Espeon VMAX, each with three holo basic Energy of its type.",
